# Konteks build: pyproject.toml, uv.lock, server/, spike/, web/ (dashboard), tests/ dan tiga berkas deploy/
# (autodeploy.sh, compose.yaml, Dockerfile.splat; ketiganya hanya dipakai tahap test).
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!server/
!spike/
!web/
!tests/
!deploy/autodeploy.sh
!deploy/compose.yaml
!deploy/Dockerfile.splat
**/__pycache__
web/node_modules
web/.next
web/out
